  "label": "Agility Stereotype",
  "description": "A cultural trope that associates physical agility with athleticism, sports ability, or general physical competence. In contrast to the 'nerdy' stereotype, this trope is often used humorously to imply that someone lacking agility is 'unfit' or 'unathletic', which is the punchline of the meme.",
